| 32 | AFTER | the keeper rite's gates: `P27` at its re-entry witness, `B1`'s owed slices, `L25` to `L29`, `L31`, `K22` (riding `C6`), `F11`'s signed channel and after it `L17-4` caps phase 4, the slices 6 and 7 and `X0b` that `M2` gathers, the compose projection confirmed by hand, the joined gate, the phone walk (`M3`), the pre-rite (#/side-lanes, the porch's compound rite), the keeper rite (`M4`) | The keeper rite keeps every qualification its rulings name; the dogfood hearth runs ahead of it and waives none. |

